// Power Platform dev container template
// Docs: https://github.com/TALXIS/tools-agentbox/tree/master/src/container/templates/power-platform
//
// This is all a project needs. The image carries its own devcontainer config (a devcontainer.metadata
// label) that every devcontainer tool merges in: tool updates and the keyring on every start, the
// TALXIS/skills plugin registration on create, PATH, ports, and VS Code extensions for those who use
// VS Code. It updates with the image, so nothing here needs to change when AgentBox does.
// Add your project's own Features and settings below as usual.
{
    "name": "Power Platform",
    "image": "ghcr.io/talxis/tools-agentbox/image:latest",

    "customizations": {
        "codespaces": {
            "openFiles": ["README.md"]
        }
    }
}
